# Models for the OpenCode implementer agent (.opencode/agents/implementer.md), started by
# scripts/ai/spawn.sh. Copy to .opencode/team.env (gitignored). No model ID is committed anywhere
# else. The lead (Claude Code) reviews every diff itself; Claude subagents (Sonnet, Haiku) are
# started by the lead, not from here (docs/ai-workflow/README.md, "The team").
#
# List the models your OpenCode Go subscription offers:   scripts/ai/models.sh
# Check that it actually answers (funds, region):         scripts/ai/doctor.sh --live
# Format: provider/model, e.g. opencode-go/<id>.
# API, DB, dashboard (spawn.sh default, or --model implement): e.g. opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash
OC_MODEL_IMPLEMENT=
# Storefront UI adapted from Paper (spawn.sh --model ui): e.g. opencode-go/glm-5.3
OC_MODEL_UI=
